          <item row="0" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_Info">
            <property name="styleSheet">
             <string notr="true">background-color: #0E1116;
color: white</string>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Hi it’s a fast guide of our application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;First of all, when you open our application, explorer opens and you are prompted to upload tracks to this folder. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Supported formats: mp3, wav, aac. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;The App will ask you the genre of your track, and description(if you want). Of course then you can change it if you want. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;After that you can listen these tracks. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;At the top of the window you can see buttons. Buttons “Compositions” and “Albums” switch viewing modes (tracks and playlists). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Also there you will see button “Add files”. Using this button will open a folder for you to download new tracks(after using you should to push button “Update” or restart TrackPlayer.) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;In the albums section, you can create your playlist by clicking the button below, there you will need to choose how to create an album, by yourself or according to your mood. If you choose to create it yourself, then you will be offered the entire list of your tracks and you can add them, then enter the name of the playlist and its description. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;At any time, you can open track or album information and change it. On the left you will see the tracks that are currently playing (of the selected album or just all the added tracks).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;On the bottom panel there are all the buttons for managing a track or playlist, such as: shuffle, pause, next track, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Thank you for using our App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
